0..75 Comment "// A choice that commits to its left branch once a cut stands there, over a"
76..151 Comment "// sort graded by how a computation may end: `bot` for one that cuts, `top`"
152..227 Comment "// for one that fails. The law is read on the command face; a call choosing"
228..305 Comment "// between two operations nests them where the cell layer reads values, so it"
306..377 Comment "// normalizes over terms instead, each operation carrying the grade its"
378..453 Comment "// sorting fixes, and a call whose arguments ask one grade at two places is"
454..468 Comment "// ill sorted."
470..546 Comment "/// Choice with cut over a grade-indexed sort: `cutLeft` commits to the left"
547..621 Comment "/// branch whatever grade the right one stands at, so the choice between a"
622..660 Comment "/// cut and a failure reaches the cut."
661..663 Other "@["
664..674 Other "normalizes"
674..675 Other "("
675..676 StringLit "\""
676..699 StringLit "orBot(cut, fail) ~> cut"
699..700 StringLit "\""
700..701 Other ")"
702..703 Other "]"
